  "label": "Humor Through Objectification",
  "description": "A comedic technique where humor is derived from the degrading or sexualized portrayal of a person, often a woman, in a context that reduces them to their physical attributes. This meme uses this technique by framing the woman’s body as the punchline to a mundane situation, relying on the viewer’s understanding of objectification as a source of humor.",
